00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:35.354
if there is some warped sense of reality

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:36.222
to suggest that.

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:36.556
Okay.

00:07:36.556 --> 00:07:36.689
Well,

00:07:36.689 --> 00:07:38.224
you didn't want me to look at the past.

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:39.492
How about right now?

00:07:39.492 --> 00:07:40.760
Well, that actually moves the needle

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:41.360
for the DOJ,

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.962
of course, is not going to happen.

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:43.229
Yeah.

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:43.896
In general,

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:45.264
I like it when people run for president

00:07:45.264 --> 00:07:46.265
to save the country

00:07:46.265 --> 00:07:47.733
and not to save themselves

00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:49.802
because I'm old fashioned in that regard.

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:50.937
And so, you know,

00:07:50.937 --> 00:07:53.973
it's really I do think he ran very early.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:55.475
I mean, as soon as the midterms is over,

00:07:55.475 --> 00:07:56.676
I ran for president.

00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:58.311
You're trying to get ahead.

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.879
Not a crisis for the country.

00:07:59.879 --> 00:08:00.480
Your leadership

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.047
trying to get ahead

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:02.048
of all these indictments

00:08:02.048 --> 00:08:03.382
and I hope people don't keep falling for.

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:03.783
There was

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:05.384
some polling from CBS this weekend

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:07.620
that indicated Republican primary voters

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.988
strongly prefer that

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:09.522
he talk

00:08:09.522 --> 00:08:11.657
most about his plans

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.526
for the country in another term.

00:08:13.526 --> 00:08:14.894
They were far less interested

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:16.395
in talking about investigations

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:18.631
or relitigating the 2020 election.

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:19.932
This thing being this thing

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:20.800
being on the front burner.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:21.334
Of course, he's

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:22.602
going to end his speech in Georgia

00:08:22.602 --> 00:08:23.536
this weekend.

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:25.805
He talked for 40 minutes or something

00:08:26.172 --> 00:08:27.707
about about this stuff.

00:08:27.707 --> 00:08:28.307
And so

00:08:28.307 --> 00:08:30.042
there is a messaging challenge in this

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:30.710
and that

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:32.311
I guess the possibility exists

00:08:32.311 --> 00:08:33.412
Republican primary voters

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:34.280
might start wondering,

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.181
do you really have a plan

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:36.082
for the next war?

00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:36.883
I waited to go to this

00:08:36.883 --> 00:08:38.551
rally and I just had to listen to this.

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:40.319
I mean, I don't know.

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:41.954
All right. Thank you. All very much.

